# {{project_name}}

An allowlist-gated token where transfers are restricted to addresses approved
by an admin, generated by
[soroban-forge](https://github.com/soroban-forge-labs/soroban-forge) from the
`allowlist-token` template.

## How it works

The admin manages an allowlist of addresses. Only allowlisted addresses can
send or receive tokens. The admin can mint tokens to allowlisted addresses.

## Develop

```sh
cargo test
stellar contract build
```

## Deploy to testnet

```sh
stellar contract deploy \
  --wasm target/wasm32v1-none/release/{{crate_name}}.wasm \
  --source-account <your-identity> \
  --network testnet \
  -- --admin <ADMIN_ADDRESS>
```

